sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Customer
  participant A as AI agent
  participant S as Business website
  box rgb(245,249,255) Edge tier
    participant W as Worker
    participant D as D1
  end
  box rgb(255,250,246) Control plane
    participant L as Legible
  end
  actor Owner

  Customer->>A: Under $400, Saturday or a weekday?
  A->>S: Read the site
  S-->>A: One link line
  A->>W: GET /b/{slug} (Accept: text/markdown)
  W->>D: Load record, log page_hit
  W-->>A: Confirmed facts and stated unknowns
  A->>W: GET /b/{slug}/quote?...&format=json
  Note over W,D: Deterministic: variants, add-ons,<br/>fees, zones, tax, closures
  W->>D: Log quote, and dead_end if stuck
  W-->>A: Total, or the named blocker
  A->>W: POST /b/{slug}/request or /ask
  W->>D: Store item, log event
  L->>W: GET /admin/businesses/{slug}/events
  L-->>Owner: Inbox and Bookings
  Owner->>L: Reply
  L->>W: POST /admin/items/{id}/reply
  A->>W: GET /b/{slug}/r/{id}
  W-->>A: The owner's reply
  loop Every 6 hours
    L->>L: Review traces
    L-->>Owner: New questions, unmet demand
  end
